{"Annotation cleanup logs at Error level unconditionally even when err is nil, which will spam error logs and mask real production errors in all three cleanup paths (by time, by count, orphan tags)": 0.9861637949943542, "Cleanup service ticker interval was changed from 10 minutes to 1 minute, which appears to be a debugging artifact not mentioned in PR description, and conflicts with the 9-minute timeout designed for the 10-minute cycle": 0.9787682890892029, "Cleanup logs include full ID lists which creates very large log lines and log bloat": 0.9285528063774109, "In TestIntegrationAnnotationCleanUp, the per-subtest DB cleanup is registered after data creation and assertions, so any failure before registration leaves the shared DB dirty and can cascade-fail subsequent subtests": 0.8103712797164917}